[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the tailgate.</p><p>Remove the rear parcel shelf.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429584\">7040B10</a></p><p>1. Release the retaining button, using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the right side trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045111.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Subwoofer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428762\">P49</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the subwoofwer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045112.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the subwoofer is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Position the subwoofer and fix it using\nthe bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the side trim and do up the retainers.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429584\">7040B10</a></p><p>Positon the parcel shelf</p><p>Ensure the subwoofwer is working efficiently.</p>"]]